10.4.111   y''+[\lambda^2x+q(x,\lambda)]y=0 where x varies in a bounded interval a<x<b that includes the origin and where, for each fixed l in S, g(x,\lambda) is continuous in x for a<x<b, the following asymptotic representations hold.
